Package: RdistNN
Title: Generalized U-Statistics and Z-Estimation with Pluggable Scores
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Jakob", "Juergens", , "info@jakobjuergens.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fast, extensible framework for generalized U-statistics and Z-estimation
    with a pluggable score (kernel) interface. Uses compiled C++ fast paths when
    available and falls back to batched R evaluation otherwise. Supports complete
    and incomplete subsampling, batched evaluation, and variance estimation via
    delete-1 jackknife.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    methods,
    stats,
    Rcpp
LinkingTo:
    Rcpp
Suggests: 
    nleqslv,
    minpack.lm,
    optimx,
    nloptr,
    quantreg,
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
SystemRequirements: C++17
Encoding: UTF-8
ByteCompile: true
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
